<title>AUSTRIA: GCC OIL MINISTERS IN TALKS AHEAD OF OPEC MEETING.</title>
<headline>GCC OIL MINISTERS IN TALKS AHEAD OF OPEC MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The four OPEC oil ministers of the Gulf Cooperation Council (GCC) met for talks on Tuesday ahead of the producer group's full conference scheduled to open at 1400 GMT on Wednesday, a delegate said.</p>
<p>The GCC ministers comprise those from Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, Qatar and the United Arab Emirates.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
